WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:09.868
Eighty years of Canadian federal actions — from the Veterans Charter of 1945 to the debt crisis of 2025 — searchable, filterable, and scored for impact.

00:00:09.818 --> 00:00:25.284
This timeline documents the arc: from post-war promise through the Somalia Affair, the Sponsorship Scandal, one hundred and fifty-eight soldiers killed in Afghanistan, the invocation of the Emergencies Act, MAID deaths exceeding fifteen thousand per year, and a national debt that doubled in a single decade.

00:00:25.284 --> 00:00:27.772
The pattern is not incompetence.

00:00:27.772 --> 00:00:30.079
It is institutional decay.
